==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 2 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mareep Drop Event]], which ran from January 1 to 18, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragon Majesty|Swablu|56}} from the {{TCG|Dragon Majesty}} expansion.
*'''Find a Friend''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Togepi|88}} from {{TCG|Great Encounters}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

